Error [E1111]: parallel item cannot use `fn(Int) -> Int` across workers
  --> tests/ui/parallel_function_worker_type.jet:7:27
    |
  7 |     bad_item :: callbacks.para_filter((callback: fn(Int) -> Int) => true)
    |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: parallel collection workers may only share or transfer thread-safe owned values
 Fix: copy the data into a plain owned value, or keep this operation sequential

